  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000098">
    <xc846f0e1:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <xaf09014d:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000033"/>
    <x59a354be:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A data format specification is the information content borne by the document published defining the specification.
Example: The ISO document specifying what encompasses an XML document; The instructions in a XSD file</x59a354be:IAO_0000115>
    <x59a354be:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">2009-03-16: provenance: term imported from OBI_0000187, which had original definition "A data format specification is a plan which organizes
information. Example: The ISO document specifying what encompasses an
XML document; The instructions in a XSD file"</x59a354be:IAO_0000116>
    <x59a354be:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">OBI branch derived</x59a354be:IAO_0000119>
    <x59a354be:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">OBI_0000187</x59a354be:IAO_0000119>
    <xaf09014d:label xml:lang="en">data format specification</xaf09014d:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N868d60ff57b44a2ca9aacff6c768b77c">
    <xeb179d48:intersectionOf rdf:nodeID="N856e7c68147347fa8deae9d2fc7c0c77"/>
    <xc846f0e1:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
