    <xaf09014d:label xml:lang="en">conference poster</xaf09014d:label>
    <x063752c9:definition>A Conference Poster is a visual presentation of research findings, displayed at an academic or professional conference to facilitate discussion and knowledge exchange.</x063752c9:definition>
