    <xaf09014d:label xml:lang="en">agent role</xaf09014d:label>
    <x063752c9:definition xml:lang="en">Role of an independent continuant that is realized through an agent's actions, enabling the agent to perform specific functions or achieve particular outcomes within a system or context.</x063752c9:definition>
